[PrintTextModified Text:晚餐结束后，艾玛她们去了淋浴房洗澡。|#0101Adv17_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她们昨天也来洗过，所以她们都知道，<br>淋浴房里有标记了各个囚犯编号的存衣柜。<br>里面整齐地放着一整套的替换衣服，包括内衣裤在内。|#0101Adv17_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:根据规定，穿过的衣服<br>要投进淋浴房内设置的<br>垃圾滑槽里丢掉。|#0101Adv17_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:竟然要丢掉衣服……咕唔唔，太浪费了……|#0101Adv17_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这条垃圾滑槽，联通着地下的焚烧炉哦。<br>我在地下看到过焚烧炉室。|#0101Adv17_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，听你这么一讲……|#0101Adv17_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

