[PrintTextModified Text:（之前在探索地下的时候，确实见到过焚烧炉室）|#0101Adv17_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（魔女图鉴的规定有写，<br>　说是【每周一15时启动】）|#0101Adv17_Ema003|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; 回想ここまで
; ========================================

@Wait WaitMode:0.2
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} TintColor:white Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:30_1

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:明明还能穿欸！|#0101Adv17_Hanna002| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:说不定是因为我们是预备魔女才会这样。<br>穿过的东西都要烧掉，感觉像是某种偏见。|#0101Adv17_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯……|#0101Adv17_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:也有可能只是因为洗衣服很麻烦！|#0101Adv17_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不过我感觉这个查得不是很严，<br>不愿意的话不丢掉也可以吧。|#0101Adv17_Sherry004| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:呜……虽然很不愿意，<br>但是要是被抓到违反了规定，不知道会遭怎样的处罚……|#0101Adv17_Hanna003| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:真是没办法，该死～～！|#0101Adv17_Hanna004| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

