[PrintTextModified Text:——而且每天都要我们穿一模一样的衣服！<br>应该至少给我们准备一套睡衣才对。|#0101Adv17_Hanna005| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:冲完澡后，汉娜还继续吐着苦水。<br>艾玛只好露出苦笑。|#0101Adv17_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:算啦算啦。<br>虽说是一样的衣服，有得换就谢天谢地了。|#0101Adv17_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:说不定这是典狱长的私人喜好哦。|#0101Adv17_Sherry005| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛、雪莉、汉娜她们三人正走在过道上，<br>热乎乎的身体还冒着白色的蒸气。|#0101Adv17_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:呵，看来它的喜好还不算太差……|#0101Adv17_Hanna006| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:看来你还蛮喜欢的耶。|#0101Adv17_Sherry006| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Flushed1

[PrintTextModified Text:才、才才才才没有吧？一点都不喜欢哦？|#0101Adv17_Hanna007| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（总感觉……这样的小打小闹也蛮不赖的）|#0101Adv17_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:走在路上的艾玛微微弯起了嘴角。|#0101Adv17_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（我很向往像这样子<br>　可以和朋友一起边走边聊天的时光）|#0101Adv17_Ema007|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（当然了，我们是囚犯，这里是监狱……<br>　差点不知不觉，就把这件事忘了）|#0101Adv17_Ema008|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，艾玛，汉娜，你们快看手机。|#0101Adv17_Sherry007| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉忽然打断了话题，<br>于是艾玛和汉娜拿出了手机。|#0101Adv17_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:只见【莲见蕾雅】亮起了“正在直播”的灯，<br>屏幕上显示出蕾雅的脸。|#0101Adv17_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

