[PrintTextModified Text:"（刚刚食堂的事让大家都觉得很害怕。<br>　为了安抚大家，蕾雅才开直播讲话的……她真的很了不起……）|#0101Adv17_Ema009|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（而我只会想着自己的事……）|#0101Adv17_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1
[PrintTextModified Text:哼，这样的东西根本没有看的价值。|#0101Adv17_Hanna008| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜嘴上说着嫌弃，可视线还是<br>紧紧盯着手机不放。|#0101Adv17_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1,ArmR2,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:哦～|#0101Adv17_Sherry008| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉好像十分在意这个反应，<br>于是乎，她忽然间拿走了汉娜的手机。|#0101Adv17_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:！|#0101Adv17_Hanna009| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜慌了神，<br>伸手就要取回映在手机上的蕾雅的身影。|#0101Adv17_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:你在干什么！？把手机还给我！|#0101Adv17_Hanna010| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1,ArmR17,ArmL4

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜，你这么拼命抢手机，<br>意思是你其实很喜欢蕾雅，对不对～？|#0101Adv17_Sherry009| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉拿着手机左晃右晃，<br>汉娜的脸涨得通红，视线也跟着手机左来右去。|#0101Adv17_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1
