[PrintTextModified Text:你个猩猩女！快还给我！！|#0101Adv17_Hanna011| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1
