[PrintTextModified Text:呵呵呵，来抓我呀～|#0101Adv17_Sherry010| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:面对开始你追我赶的二人，<br>艾玛露出傻眼的表情，叹了一口气。|#0101Adv17_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这期间，连艾玛自己也<br>目不转睛的望着屏幕上的蕾雅。|#0101Adv17_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

